{"id":"vod_md_4366","vodId":"4366","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"新世纪福音战士","name_cn":"新世纪福音战士","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"26集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230907-1/1f1dd57a9079b831f87b25bd6d9cbea4.jpg"},"summary":"突袭世界的大灾难“第二次冲击”后，世界在废墟之上重建。14岁的少年碇真嗣被父亲碇元渡叫到第3新东京市。本以为能见到父亲迎接的他，却见到名为“ 使徒”的巨大生物与军队交火。危急之下，特务机关NERV的葛成美里将真嗣救下，并将其带往碇元渡所统领的NERV总部。但迎接真嗣的，却是是父亲冷酷地命令：驾驶称为“EVA”的巨大人型机器人与使徒战斗。本已表示拒绝的真嗣，看到重伤的替补驾驶员绫波丽后，决定遵从父亲的命令。就这样，从未受过作战训练的真嗣，准备驾驶EVA初号机迎战使徒。不断袭来的使徒，身份不明的绫波丽，从德国来的驾驶员惣流·明日香·兰格蕾，14岁的少年要面对远超自己能力的挑战。而碇元渡不动声色地观察一切，一个称为“人类补完计划”的神秘计划正在按照他的计划实现。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-07 09:10:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/HnADG8Pt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/YAceu91E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/hPC7m19E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/3eAmKYFA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/u80e8NGE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/GtiOfXWg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/RXyWOdmJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/I4tH31b5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/BxoTUGL0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/gHFHXdEV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/pPORohc1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/Pm4C5MsG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/l8FLBZho/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/EytinwVX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.mod